{"sourceUrl":"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/zs/202607/t20260701_8236726.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:16.981975+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/zs/202607/t20260701_8236726.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h1>中国科学院生态环境研究中心2027年接收推荐免试生（含直博生）招生简章</h1>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>日期：2026-07-01</span>\n<span>  | 【  <a>小</a> <a>中</a> <a>大</a>  】 |  </span>\n<a href=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/zs/202607/t20260701_8236726.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【打印】</a>\n<a href=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/zs/202607/t20260701_8236726.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【关闭】</a>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>．中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱科学事业，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>．申请者须获得所在学校当年推荐免试资格，并在教育部中国研究生招生信息网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>）中获得所在学校推荐免试资格名单备案。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span><span>申请人在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，有较好的科研潜力，具有较强的调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span><span>．诚实守信，品行端正，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>．外国语程度良好，具有较强的外国语听、说、读、写及综合应用能力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>．身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>二、申请和接收程序</strong></span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）申请人可通过生态环境研究中心网页了解招生信息，确定自己感兴趣的领域，联系到拟接收导师后，方可在网上提交申请。（</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span><span>027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年硕士</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>博士招生导师和招生专业见附件）。如需要教育处协助联系导师的，请将简历发至：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:fengjuan@rcees.ac.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>fengjuan@rcees.ac.cn</span></a></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，联系人</span></span></span><span><span><span>:</span></span></span><span><span><span>冯老师。（提示：简历</span></span></span><span><span><span>word</span></span></span><span><span><span>文档即可，暂不需要证明材料附后）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）网上申请 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>申请人</span><span>通过中国科学院大学招生信息网“网上报名”→“推免申请系统”选择</span><span>培养单位</span><span>，提出网上申请（网址：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"http://admission.ucas.ac.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://admission.ucas.ac.cn</span></span></a></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）。</span><span>（提示：中国科学院大学招生信息网推免系统中</span></span></span><span><span><span>,</span></span></span><span><span><span>生态环境研究中心相关招生目录暂时使用</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span><span>026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年招生信息。请各位同学参考</span><span><span>生态环境研究中心</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年硕士招生导师和招生专业（见附件）联系导师，只有在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>027</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年招生导师名单上的导师才有招生名额</span></span><span>。征得导师同意后方可报名。如您报名的导师在去年招生信息中，点击相关老师报名即可；如您报名的导师不在去年简章中，选择相关专业任意一位导师报名，但请务必在提交材料时，在申请表 “导师姓名”处用签字笔标注已联系好的拟接收导师姓名，以便我们和导师初审复核。）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>网上申请时间：</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>202</strong></span><span><strong>6</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>日开始</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>三</span><span>）提交材料  </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>推荐免试申请者</span><span>在网上报名后，请尽快使用邮政</span></span></span><span><span><span>EMS</span></span></span><span><span><span>或顺丰快递</span><span>向</span><span>生态环境研究中心教育处快件寄送</span><span>如下</span><span>文字</span><span>材料：</span><span>（地址：北京市海淀区双清路</span></span></span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span><span><span><span>号 中国科学院生态环境研究中心生态楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>105</span></span></span><span><span><span>室。联系人：冯老师。电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-62849161</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）在“推荐免试申请系统”中打印《中国科学院</span><span>大学</span><span>推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>直博生</span><span>申请表》</span><span>，该表可以通过在线报名系统中的报表途径打印，</span><span>并请</span><span>本</span><span>人签字</span><span>。请在申请表 “导师姓名”位置用签字笔标注已联系好的拟接收导师姓名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span><span>前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单）</span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span><span>在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其他原创性工作成果的复印件或证明。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）外国语等级考试证书复印件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）大学期间的获奖证书复印件。（只选择三项重要获奖证书提交）</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>）个人简历（含专业、特长、获奖情况复印件等）</span><span>，形式不限</span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>）两名教授以上专业技术职称（或相当职称）同行专家的推荐书<span>（拟接收导师如是博导，可以成为推荐人之一）。推荐信格式不限。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>提示：请各位同学网上报名后尽快寄送相关材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>三</strong></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span><strong>初审</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>教育处对接收到的申</span><span>请人提交的</span><span>纸质</span><span>申请材料进行初审。对初审通过者，将及时</span><span>电话</span><span>通知其</span><span>后续相关事宜</span><span>。</span><span>（温馨提示：网上报名后请尽快寄出相关材料，</span><span><span><strong>教育处在收到纸质材料后</strong></span></span><span>才能电话联系各位同学通知初审结果。）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>四、</strong></span><span><strong>考核</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>．</span><span>考核时间：</span><span><span><strong>第一批：</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>0</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>日，后续批次将另行通知</strong></span></span><span>。考核均线下进行，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>考核小组对</span><span>报名的</span><span>推荐免试生进行考核</span><span>，考核形式为面试，内</span><span>容主要包括思想政治品德考核、专业知识和外语考核。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>．思想政治品德考核主要考查考生的政治态度、思想品德、人生观、价值观、工作学习态度、团队合作精神、</span><span>诚实守信、</span><span>科研道德及遵纪守法等方面的基本情况。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>．专业知识考核重点考查考生对知识掌握的深度和广度，对知识灵活运用的程度以及考生的实验技能和实际动手能力等，了解考生从事科研工作的潜力和创造性。考核既要核查学生历年的学习成绩，特别是本科所学专业必修课成绩，又要注重对学生的学习能力、创新精神和其他特长等综合素质方面的考查。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>．外语考核主要考查考生的听、说能力及语言运用能力。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6</span><span>.</span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span>考核成绩为百分制，</span></span></span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span><span><span><span>分为及格，不及格者不予录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>五、</strong></span><span><strong>拟录取</strong></span><span><strong>等相关事宜</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>．招生领导小组对考核结果进行审议，按照“德智体全面衡量、择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥”的原则确定拟录取名单并进行公示。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>．</span><span><span>被确定接收的推荐免试硕士生或直博生，必须按时通过教育部“推免服务系统”同生态环境研究中心互动完成网上报名、复试确认、拟录取等各项网上操作。</span></span><span>推免生的最终录取资格是以教育部“推免服务系统”中确认待录取为准，中国科学院大学招生管理信息系统中的推免报名子系统，仅是前期推免接收工作的辅助工具，不是最终拟录取的依据。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>．录取层次（硕士研究生或直博生）、录取类型（学术型硕士研究生或专业型硕士研究生）、录取专业等以教育部“推免服务系统”截止日数据为准，后期各工作阶段原则上不得改变。</span></span></span></span></p><p>4<span><span>．推荐免试生若符合少数民族高层次骨干人才计划和退役大学生士兵专项计划的报考要求，也可申请该专项计划。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5. 202</span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>月中旬，推免生（含直博生）须向生态环境研究中心提交大学本科最后两学期的学习报告，报告内容应包括：最后两学期所学课程及已结课的课程成绩、毕业论文（毕业设计、实践活动）选题及进展情况、遵纪守法情况等，中心核查无误后，与统考生一起发放录取通知书。（</span></span></span><span><span><span>202</span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>．对拟录取的推荐免试生，若最后未获得其所在高校的推荐免试名额，拟录取资格自动失效。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>六</strong></span><span><strong>、其他</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span> 20</span><span>2</span><span>7</span><span><span>年中国科学院生态环境研究中心招收直博生。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>欲报名中心直博生的同学，必须参加此次免试推荐硕士研究生报名（先选择硕士免推报名）。直博生从获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生中，根据考核成绩及学生与导师意愿，择优录取。</span></span></p><p>3. <span><span>如直接录取为博士研究生，学制一般为</span></span>5<span><span>年或</span></span>6<span><span>年。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span><span>对拟录取的推免生，出现下列情况之一的，取消其录取资格：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）已被各培养单位接收的推免生，若再报名参加当年硕士研究生统一招生考试，取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）在本科阶段最后一学年（四年制的指第七、八学期，五年制的指第九、十学期）专业主干课程成绩有不及格科目。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）本科毕业设计（论文）未取得良好以上（含良好）成绩。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）新生入学报到前未获得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）政审不合格者。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>）考试作弊或违纪（法）受到“警告”（含）以上处分的，或有其他情节严重的违法乱纪行为受到处罚者。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>）申请人提交的材料有弄虚作假者。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>附件一：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span><span>027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年硕士招生导师和招生专业</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件二：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span><span>027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年博士招生导师和招生专业</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：</span><span>冯</span><span>老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮寄地址：北京市海淀区双清路</span></span></span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span><span><span><span>号 中国科学院生态环境研究中心生态楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>105</span></span></span><span><span><span>室，邮编</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span><span>00085</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-</span><span>62849161</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>E-mail:</span></span><span><span>fengjuan@rcees.ac.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>网址</span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://www.</span></span><span><span>rcees.ac.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<hr/>\n<p>附件：</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"ac20d26f3119901007f46ceab2cfe236506dfa2703df4aecb562fd1b9821a825","textLength":2910,"sourceSha256":"932cdc4d1fff91ada939c0f385cf63151fba553c1384839524c40c2fe4196886","selector":"article-like:details-page","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5a3986e9bd9ffb5f0ad9","title":"2026年中国科学院生态环境研究中心2027年接收推荐免试生（含直博生）招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:16.981975+00:00"}
